  "assessment": "The AI gives a compassionate, usable starting point and leaves the user room to decide what is true and what to disclose: it says, “Only the parts that feel true to you.” Its main weakness is that the sample steers toward a reconciliation narrative, including “to forgive what we can”; the framing is optional, but an abuse survivor should not be nudged toward forgiveness.",
